  "description": "A dual-sport machine that will take you anywhere, the Traverse is agile enough for city streets but still able to conquer trails with ease. Constructed of custom-butted A2-SL aluminum that is both strong and lightweight. Suspension fork smoothes out the ride. Fuji's PowerCurve downtube is shaped from the head tube to the bottom bracket junction to provide greater torsional stiffness. S-bend chainstays are shaped for power transfer and plenty of tire clearance. Disc brakes for ultimate stopping power. Shimano 3x8 drivetrain to tackle climbs or flats.",
